# Persona-system ledgers (added 2026-05-28 with persona-system Wave 1):
# - persona-findings.jsonl: append-only findings written by /deploy-verify Phase 3.5,
#   /bug-resolver verify (Hamilton), /omega-steward Phase 4 (DHH/Howard/Hickey),
#   /council --persona, /personas batch. Each finding may quote sensitive-path
#   code; cross-fork-leak guard treats this path as sensitive.
# - persona-review-spend.jsonl: per-invocation LLM cost; sums into V2_BUDGET_USD=$300.
# - persona-monthly-review-*.md: precision-review reports written by Wave 3
#   CLI; include finding samples by hash_only reference (per cross-fork-leak guard).
data/persona-findings.jsonl
data/persona-review-spend.jsonl
data/persona-monthly-review-*.md
